<mxCell id="legend" value="LEGEND
🖥 Device/VM icon = endpoint or server
🔀 Switch = Proxmox vSwitch / VLAN-aware bridge
🧱 Firewall = Proxmox Firewall / inter-zone segmentation
🟣 Dashed = monitoring / security telemetry
🔴 Red dashed = explicitly denied path
🟠 Pomerium = PEP / access gateway
* = depends on final PoC configuration; do not claim unless implemented" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#9ca3af;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1100" y="95" width="580" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="foot" value="PoC addressing proposal. IPs/VLANs are design values, not implementation facts from the source documents.
Client addressing is DHCP; static IPs are reserved for infrastructure/VMs. VLAN 60 separates Proxmox management from application/data traffic." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=10;fontColor=#4b5563;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1080" width="1640" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
